, reporting a 15% YoY growth in AUM to Rs. 222 billion and a 16% YoY net profit increase to Rs. 1.7 billion.\nThe company raised Rs. 975 crore via NCDs, improved asset quality with GNPA at 1.19%, and plans further branch expansion, targeting 25% disbursement growth in FY27.","summary":"Aavas Financiers Ltd held its Q3FY26 earnings call, reporting a 15% YoY growth in AUM to Rs. 222 billion and a 16% YoY net profit increase to Rs. 1.7 billion.\nThe company raised Rs. 975 crore via NCDs, improved asset quality with GNPA at 1.19%, and plans further branch expansion, targeting 25% disbursement growth in FY27.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5fd1d46d-7db9-4920-9831-7dc14a54b3f7.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-12T11:44:03","source":"BSE"},{"id":"807270740811036672","title":"Aavas Financiers aims for 25% disbursement growth by FY27.\nThe company is also expanding its branch network during this period.","summary":"Aavas Financiers aims for 25% disbursement growth by FY27.\nThe company is also expanding its branch network during this period.","url":"https://sqst.in/Yqdau","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-05T20:55:42","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"807203411993540992","title":"AAVAS Financiers' AUM rose 15% YoY to Rs. 222 bn; PAT up 13% YoY at Rs. 4.74 bn.\nSpread improved 40 bps to 5.34%, NIM at 7.82%; stable asset quality with 1+ DPD at 3.8%.","summary":"AAVAS Financiers' AUM rose 15% YoY to Rs. 222 bn; PAT up 13% YoY at Rs. 4.74 bn.\nSpread improved 40 bps to 5.34%, NIM at 7.82%; stable asset quality with 1+ DPD at 3.8%.","url":"https://sqst.in/L2VaG","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-05T16:28:10","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"473250","title":"Aavas Financiers' Q3 net profit rose to 1.7B INR from 1.46B INR YoY.\nRevenue increased to 5.74B INR in Q3, up from 5.12B INR YoY.","summary":"Aavas Financiers' Q3 net profit rose to 1.7B INR from 1.46B INR YoY.\nRevenue increased to 5.74B INR in Q3, up from 5.12B INR YoY.","url":"","imageUrl